  "description": "Fluent WinForms form builder library targeting .NET Framework 4.7.2.\n      Declare fields with a chained API and get a fully laid-out, scrollable,\n      validated Panel back. Supports TextBox, CheckBox, ComboBox, DateTimePicker,\n      NumericUpDown, read-only Labels, section separators, and inline Buttons.\n      Fields support required validation, custom validators, placeholder text,\n      tooltips, read-only mode, and onChange callbacks out of the box.",
